{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19171","headline":"乐天寄重和晚达冬青一篇因成再答 · 刘禹锡","name":"乐天寄重和晚达冬青一篇因成再答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风云变化饶年少，光景蹉跎属老夫。\n秋隼得时凌汗漫，寒龟饮气受泥涂。\n东隅有失谁能免，北叟之言岂便无。\n振臂犹堪呼一掷，争知掌下不成卢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}